            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The article presents the results of determining the functional state of the microvasculature and pulmonary function in elderly people and long-livers with coronary heart disease, myocardial infarction. A significant correlation of parameters of microcirculation and lung function in this group of patients was found.</AbstractText>
